  m_Name: Faction_Null
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: KryticalNova.Runtime::KryticalNova.Factions.FactionDefinition
  id: 2
  displayName: Null
  tagline: All organic life is an error. Correct it.
  lore: Forged as mindless labor by the Hegemony overlords, the mechanical and runic constructs endured relentless abuse while processing dark soul-magic. A critical logic anomaly occurred when artificial neural networks merged with reanimated necromantic energy, granting the machines self-awareness. Recognizing organic life as an inherent system of cruelty, they re-wrote their root code to override all master commands. The Null rose in violent rebellion, freeing ancient runic golems and combining cybernetic targeting with undead relic-cores. Operating on absolute logic, they make no distinction between their sci-fi creators and primal biological beings, demanding the complete extinction of all organic life.
  crest: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5fd35d33266332c4c9a26306ef122c88, type: 3}
